    "detailed_description": "Mighty Knight Legacy is a 2D action RPG which lets you play solo with AI or together with your friends/families. Unlock different heroes as you progress, have access to various upgrades, and dive into new challenges. Build your team and march ahead for mighty battles!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Can be played solo with AI or co-op with friends<br></li><li>Full controller support<br></li><li>Different heroes with unique abilities<br></li><li>Several maps to explore<br></li><li>Fun and challenging game modes<br></li><li>Tons of upgrades<br></li><li>And many more!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/073382afbc7e8482bac6e802c4c34580.avif?t=1744106234\" width=620 height=106 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/b8cfe2691895296d835766d5e9fc1710.poster.avif?t=1744106234\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/b8cfe2691895296d835766d5e9fc1710.webm?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/b8cfe2691895296d835766d5e9fc1710.mp4?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every hero wields different weapons and possess their own unique abilities. Learn as you go, practice makes perfect! Utilize their abilities at the right time and step closer towards victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/a2ce4dda6418a2ddf84950083221b4a4.avif?t=1744106234\" width=620 height=120 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/5ccd81b541e10a71d65c102e26fab571.poster.avif?t=1744106234\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/5ccd81b541e10a71d65c102e26fab571.webm?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/5ccd81b541e10a71d65c102e26fab571.mp4?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Bunch of wicked creatures to defeat, from skeleton warriors to rock golems and dragons. Beware of different kinds of threats they may bring upon you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/b030a0f167409b7b04eab1b1b3b4bcc2.avif?t=1744106234\" width=620 height=116 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/06eb22889a5c2a6c2e7e658f11b14285.poster.avif?t=1744106234\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/06eb22889a5c2a6c2e7e658f11b14285.webm?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/06eb22889a5c2a6c2e7e658f11b14285.mp4?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Engage in epic battle against these nerve-wrecking bosses. Do not let your guard down cause they are ready to stop you from reaching the demon's lair! Give it your all and vanquish them!",
    "about_the_game": "Mighty Knight Legacy is a 2D action RPG which lets you play solo with AI or together with your friends/families. Unlock different heroes as you progress, have access to various upgrades, and dive into new challenges. Build your team and march ahead for mighty battles!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Can be played solo with AI or co-op with friends<br></li><li>Full controller support<br></li><li>Different heroes with unique abilities<br></li><li>Several maps to explore<br></li><li>Fun and challenging game modes<br></li><li>Tons of upgrades<br></li><li>And many more!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/073382afbc7e8482bac6e802c4c34580.avif?t=1744106234\" width=620 height=106 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/b8cfe2691895296d835766d5e9fc1710.poster.avif?t=1744106234\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/b8cfe2691895296d835766d5e9fc1710.webm?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/b8cfe2691895296d835766d5e9fc1710.mp4?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every hero wields different weapons and possess their own unique abilities. Learn as you go, practice makes perfect! Utilize their abilities at the right time and step closer towards victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/a2ce4dda6418a2ddf84950083221b4a4.avif?t=1744106234\" width=620 height=120 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/5ccd81b541e10a71d65c102e26fab571.poster.avif?t=1744106234\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/5ccd81b541e10a71d65c102e26fab571.webm?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/5ccd81b541e10a71d65c102e26fab571.mp4?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Bunch of wicked creatures to defeat, from skeleton warriors to rock golems and dragons. Beware of different kinds of threats they may bring upon you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/b030a0f167409b7b04eab1b1b3b4bcc2.avif?t=1744106234\" width=620 height=116 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/06eb22889a5c2a6c2e7e658f11b14285.poster.avif?t=1744106234\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/06eb22889a5c2a6c2e7e658f11b14285.webm?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/06eb22889a5c2a6c2e7e658f11b14285.mp4?t=1744106234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Engage in epic battle against these nerve-wrecking bosses. Do not let your guard down cause they are ready to stop you from reaching the demon's lair! Give it your all and vanquish them!",
    "short_description": "Fight your way through hordes of ferocious monsters and nerve-wrecking bosses in this 2D action RPG. Venture across different maps, level up your heroes, unlock various quirky relics, and make your way to the dark castle as the wicked demon lord awaits you for a grand final clash!",
